<div class="container">

      <div class="page page-1">
         <div class="grid-main">
            <div class="wordmark"><img class="max" src="brand/logo.svg"/></div>
            <div class="hero">
               <div class="sky"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="links">
               <small class="flat"><strong>MARGINS&copy;</strong></small>
               <small class="flat">Featured work</small>
               <small class="flat">Studio</small>
            </div>
         </div>
         <div class="birds">
            <video muted loop autoplay>
               <source src="brand/hero/birds.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
         </div>
      </div>


      
      <div class="page page-3">
         <div class="grid-main">
            <div class="links top">
               <small class=""><strong>MARGINS&copy;</strong></small>
               <small>The Albany<br/>Douglas Way<br/>London SE8 4AG</small>
               <small class="">Projects<br/>Studio<br/>Approach<br/>Values<br/>Contact</small>
            </div>
            <div class="hero">MARGINS is a thoughtful and reflective design practice with a focus on culture and communities. We explore new formats in graphic design, publishing, music and food. we explicitly center intersectional perspectives and narratives, specifically the voices of women, LGBTQI+, BIPOC, disabled, working class and neurodivergent people. We put ecologically conscious thinking at the heart of our strategies. A research-led, typographic design practice. Our work spans brand identity, [spaces] motion design, and digital products. As MARGINS develops...MARGINS feels connected to environments and its people. Margins is the independent design practice of Chris Droom. As it develops, I hope this to become a co-operative group of like-minded practitioners. If you have skills in illustration, lettering, or 3d-modelling and would like to collaborate, please get in touch.
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>



      <div class="page page-2">
         <div class="grid-main">
            <div class="links top">
               <small class=""><strong>MARGINS&copy;</strong></small>
               <small class="">HIVStory<br/>London Archives</small>
               <small class="">Studio</small>
            </div>
            <div class="hero hivstory"><img class="max" src="brand/hero/hivstory.png"/></div>
            <div class="links">
               <small class="flat">Next</small>
            </div>
